# Runtime volume directories.
#
# These are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored `config/`
# matches any directory named config at any depth, which silently swallowed
# internal/config/ — the package the whole server is built on. That broke the
# build only in CI, where the omission is invisible locally.
/config/
/data/
/dev-config/
/dev-data/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Logs and editor noise
*.log
.DS_Store

# Go build artifacts
/my-cloud
/dist/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm